You are working on an existing Dental Clinic Management System. Your responsibility is to improve and extend the existing application by implementing the requirements in this document.

The objective is to develop a professional, secure, reliable, fast, responsive, user-friendly, maintainable, and future-proof Dental Clinic Management System suitable for real-world clinical operations.

